                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Earlier this month, I introduced the Expanding Service Coordinators Act with @RepBeatty and @RepBonamici. This legislation would increase funding and make reforms to strengthen our national workforce and connect residents of federally assisted housing with health care, nutrition, job training, education, and other services. There is a high demand for this investment to grow a sustainable workforce, and I encourage all of my colleagues to support this bill that would lift up working-class families.",
