                "text": "September is National Food Safety Education Month, where we recognize how to prevent foodborne illness. In a time where food assistance and nutrition education is being cut, it\u2019s important to continue to learn about how to get healthy, safe food and follow simple food safety tips to lower chances of getting sick.",
