                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In Washington state alone, over 195,000 women and children use the WIC program to buy infant formula, access critical nutrition assistance and keep their families healthy.\n\nIf the far-right refuses to negotiate to end this government shutdown, thousands of people will lose essential funding and have their livelihoods flipped upside-down. My colleagues across the aisle need to come to the table, sit down, and negotiate for the greater good of the American people.\nhttps://t.co/m6MRyNEjRk",
